# {{senseid|en|it was}} {{lb|en|proscribed}} {{contraction of|en|it|was}}.
#: {{ux|en|When I was a kid, [[it's the thought that counts|'''it's''' the thought that counted]] but, now, it's all about the [[Benjamins]].}}
# {{senseid|en|there is or there are}} {{lb|en|dialectal|nonstandard}} [[there's|There's]], [[there is]]; [[there're]], [[there are]].
